                            <comment id="505760" author="JIRAUSER24100" created="Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:38:50 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Second occurrence, 2026-11-12: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/43aa9824-eb2e-45ba-8a0f-51adde998c53" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/43aa9824-eb2e-45ba-8a0f-51adde998c53&lt;/a&gt; (review of change 70732, review-dne-part-4, el9.8).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_59 begins by unmounting the targets (umount -d -f /mnt/lustre-mds1). That umount never finished: it sat in qsd_qtype_fini() waiting on the quota slave reintegration thread (qsd_reint_0), stuck in qsd_reint_main(), while that thread kept resending LDLM enqueues on the already closed lwp import (ptlrpc_import_delay_req: IMP_CLOSED) until the suite timed out after 339 minutes. Same step and same suite timeout as the 2021 report above (hang in umount -f at start of test_59).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
